<title>USA: Springs to acquire 50 pct of American Fiber.</title>
<headline>Springs to acquire 50 pct of American Fiber.</headline>
<dateline>FORT MILL, S.C. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Springs Industries Inc said that it signed a letter of intent with American Fiber Industries Corp to acquire a 50 percent equity stake in the pillow manufacturer.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, expected to close by the end of 1996, were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
